 href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","no-unused-vars","'FaUpload' is defined but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar","'selectedFile' is assigned a value but never used.","'filePreview' is assigned a value but never used.","react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'fetchProducts'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.","ArrayExpression",["181"],"'handleFileChange' is assigned a value but never used.","'Component' is defined but never used.","'oktaAuth' is assigned a value but never used.",{"desc":"182","fix":"183"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [clientId, fetchProducts, navigate]",{"range":"184","text":"185"},[1156,1176],"[clientId, fetchProducts, navigate]"]